# Committed on purpose: the VAPID *public* key is not a secret (every
# browser receives it), but it must be present at build time or push
# subscription silently breaks for anyone who hasn't subscribed yet.
# It has to match VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY/VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY in Supabase secrets.
